    },
    {
      "function_name": "nationalRequest",
      "description": "Submit a NATIONWIDE service request into live provider sourcing: pass {name, phone, city, items_description, service_type?, address?, email?, preferred_date?, pickup_lat?, pickup_lng?, pickup_unit?, access_notes?}. It automatically creates a sourcing task, offers the job to eligible verified contractors, and escalates unfilled requests to dispatch. Use it whenever the customer wants service in a city without a verified local contractor - do not just say matching is happening; actually submit the request."
